  "id": "Lyo.Recipe.FileStorage",
  "name": "Lyo.Recipe.FileStorage",
  "area": "Plugins",
  "tagline": "Saves FileStorage bytes and writes a Recipe attachment row.",
  "description": "`IRecipeAttachmentFiles` stores any stream under `RecipeFilePaths` and inserts a `RecipeAttachmentRecord`. Roles include Document, Scan, Card, Image, and Other. Upload does not restrict content type.",
  "features": [
    "`AddRecipeFileStorage` registers the helper. Requires `IFileStorageService` and `IRecipeStore`."
